BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Autumn Canvassing Orientation
DTSTART:20260902T160000Z
DTEND:20260902T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T102521Z
UID:154ab84b-69cb-5411-a39b-c04b07ffa848
DESCRIPTION:Now more than ever\, we need help defending our right to safer
  streets! We’re hosting a virtual volunteer orientation session on Wedne
 sday\, September 2nd.\n\nWe will cover various topics including\, but not 
 limited to\, update to our appeal\, our municipal election strategy\, and 
 how to sign up for shifts.\n\n(https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/Hj
 m_LjYxS9-3PBe887Fdfg) Register for our workshop here\nURL: https://www.cyc
 leto.ca/canvassing_orientation_20260830_20260902
LOCATION:Zoom
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/canvassing_orientation_20260830_20260902
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bike Repair 101
DTSTART:20260920T190000Z
DTEND:20260920T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T102521Z
UID:39da0fb7-224d-53e1-9037-3075be00ae5a
DESCRIPTION:Join our Basic Bike Maintenance Workshop at the Cycle Toronto 
 Rec Hub to learn hands-on skills including bike fit\, safety checks\, and 
 drive train care. This session provides access to all recommended tools an
 d staff guidance to help you keep your bike safe and road-ready. You'll le
 ave knowing how to perform routine maintenance yourself and clearly unders
 tand the basics of fixing your bike.\n\nDoors: 4 PM\n\nSession: 4:00-6:00 
 PM\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_repair_101_20260920
LOCATION:Evergreen Brickworks\n550 Bayview ave\n10\nToronto ON M4W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_repair_101_20260920
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:On Bikes at the Cinema
DTSTART:20260926T000000Z
DTEND:20260926T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T102521Z
UID:81bc30fd-1267-59c5-a67b-074c94352fba
DESCRIPTION:Join Cycle Toronto for an evening of bikes\, community\, and m
 ovies at the Evergreen Brick Works.\n\nWe're screening [TBD] a Popcorn Cla
 ssic (or at least that's what we're calling it). Bring your bike\, bring a
  blanket\, and settle in for a night of great company and questionable fil
 m takes.\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/on_bikes_at_the_cinema
LOCATION:Evergreen Brickworks\n550 Bayview Ave\nBuilding 10\nToronto ON M4
 W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/on_bikes_at_the_cinema
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Parts Bin Bazaar
DTSTART:20260912T170000Z
DTEND:20260912T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T102520Z
UID:89bcdcb1-2535-55e3-a5ba-9fe1f8e44db1
DESCRIPTION:Think of it as autumn cleaning. We've all got that extra stem
 \, wheelset\, or handlebar laying around our parts bins. Bring a blanket\,
  a box of your extra parts and tools and meet some new friends! No charge 
 for entry\, space is limited. Snacks and refreshments will be provided\n\n
 Doors: 1 PM\nSession: 1:00-4:00 PM\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/the_parts_
 bin_bazaar
LOCATION:Evergreen Brickworks\n550 Bayview ave\nBuilding 10\nToronto ON M4
 W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/the_parts_bin_bazaar
END:VEVENT
